00:44:55,920 --> 00:44:59,600
nothing in this letter of accusation is true?
这封举报信上说的都不是事实？

586
00:45:06,440 --> 00:45:08,520
Then explain these photos.
这些照片妳解释一下

587
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:11,600
Is this you or not?
这上面的是不是妳？

588
00:45:21,440 --> 00:45:22,400
Can I take the photos...
我能把照片拿走…

589
00:45:22,480 --> 00:45:24,240
Until this matter is cleared up,
在问题没有搞清楚之前

590
00:45:24,320 --> 00:45:26,040
the photos stay here with me.
这照片先放我这保管

591
00:45:26,120 --> 00:45:29,160
Don't worry. No one else will see them.
妳放心，不会再有其他人看到的

592
00:45:31,720 --> 00:45:33,240
And what counts as "cleared up"?
怎么算搞清楚？

593
00:45:35,960 --> 00:45:36,840
Shen Mo.
沈墨

594
00:45:37,800 --> 00:45:39,960
First, you need to trust us completely.
妳首先得完全信任我们

595
00:45:40,760 --> 00:45:42,640
If you keep refusing to cooperate,
妳要是一直这么不配合

596
00:45:42,720 --> 00:45:44,800
the consequences could be very serious.
后果可能非常地严重

597
00:45:52,800 --> 00:45:53,720
Shen Mo.
沈墨

598
00:45:59,640 --> 00:46:00,840
Shen Mo.
沈墨

599
00:46:02,880 --> 00:46:03,840
Shen Mo.
沈墨

600
00:46:04,800 --> 00:46:06,520
So what's the story with the photos and that letter?
那照片和信是怎么回事？

601
00:46:06,600 --> 00:46:08,120
Is there nothing you want to tell me?
妳就没啥想跟我说的吗？

602
00:46:08,600 --> 00:46:10,640
Didn't Qu Bo already tell you everything?
曲波不是都跟你说过了吗？

603
00:46:11,480 --> 00:46:13,120
There's nothing I want to say right now.
我现在没什么想说的

604
00:46:13,200 --> 00:46:14,440
Just go home.
你先回家吧

605
00:46:15,520 --> 00:46:17,320
What are you staring at? Go home and stare at your mom.
看什么看呀？ 回家看你妈去

606
00:46:17,400 --> 00:46:18,600
What's wrong with you?
有病吧你？

607
00:46:19,960 --> 00:46:21,040
Fine — you don't have to talk.
妳不想说也行

608
00:46:21,120 --> 00:46:22,440
What's past is past.
这事过去也就过去了

609
00:46:22,520 --> 00:46:23,920
I can put it out of my mind.
我可以不往心里去

610
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:25,720
But next time you're short of money, can't you just tell me?
但妳以后缺钱了，能不能跟我说呀？

611
00:46:25,800 --> 00:46:26,880
I can earn money, you know.
我可以挣啊

612
00:46:27,360 --> 00:46:28,600
Whatever you want to buy, whatever you want to do,
妳想买什么、想干什么

613
00:46:28,680 --> 00:46:29,880
you can tell me.
妳都可以告诉我

614
00:46:29,960 --> 00:46:31,760
Just stop taking up with those shady people out there.
妳别在外面认识那些乱七八糟的人

615
00:46:31,840 --> 00:46:33,680
Don't let them think you're easy to push around.
别让他们觉得妳好欺负

616
00:46:38,080 --> 00:46:39,920
So you think I'm that kind of person too?
你也觉得我是那样的人？

617
00:46:41,520 --> 00:46:42,360
That's not what I meant.
我不是那意思

618
00:46:42,440 --> 00:46:44,040
I know exactly what you meant.
我知道你什么意思

619
00:46:46,240 --> 00:46:47,520
Whether I did it willingly
不管我是自愿的

620
00:46:47,600 --> 00:46:49,160
or was forced into it,
还是被迫的

621
00:46:49,240 --> 00:46:51,360
I still need to earn your forgiveness. Is that it?
我还需要取得你的原谅是吗？

622
00:46:54,000 --> 00:46:55,600
I told you a long time ago.
我早就跟你说过了

623
00:46:57,720 --> 00:46:59,280
I'm not worth your love.
我不值得你喜欢

624
00:46:59,800 --> 00:47:01,200
I don't deserve to be with you.
我没有资格和你在一起

625
00:47:01,280 --> 00:47:02,160
Do you understand me?
你听明白了吗？

626
00:47:02,240 --> 00:47:04,480
If you finally understand, then go home.
这回你听明白了，你就回去

627
00:47:04,560 --> 00:47:06,480
Let's never see each other again.
我们以后都不要再见面了

628
00:47:13,880 --> 00:47:15,640
Completely naked, they say,
真啥也没穿

629
00:47:15,720 --> 00:47:17,240
just lying there on the bed.
就那么躺床上

630
00:47:17,320 --> 00:47:18,600
Seriously?
真假的呀？

631
00:47:19,120 --> 00:47:21,360
They say she's an escort at some KTV.
说是在KTV当三陪吧

632
00:47:26,000 --> 00:47:27,480
I'm going to eat. You two coming?
我吃饭去，妳们去不去？

633
00:47:27,560 --> 00:47:28,640
-Sure, I'm in.
-Let's go.
-走，我也去
-走

634
00:48:23,880 --> 00:48:25,040
What are you doing here?
妳怎么来了？

635
00:48:26,920 --> 00:48:28,760
Come on. Dinner's on me.
走啊，请妳吃饭

636
00:48:30,440 --> 00:48:33,040
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

637
00:48:38,880 --> 00:48:40,360
Go easy on that.
妳少喝点

638
00:48:40,440 --> 00:48:41,640
You've still got work later.
待会还上班呢

639
00:48:41,720 --> 00:48:44,360
I'll just go stick a finger down my throat after.
我待会去厕所抠嗓子就好了

640
00:48:44,840 --> 00:48:47,200
More than enough to handle those bastards.
对付那些王八蛋，绰绰有余

641
00:48:48,040 --> 00:48:50,080
That's terrible for your stomach.
这样对胃不好

642
00:48:50,560 --> 00:48:51,960
Don't trade your life for money.
别要钱不要命

643
00:48:52,040 --> 00:48:53,880
Without money, what's a life even for?
没有钱，要命有啥用？

644
00:49:03,640 --> 00:49:07,720
Why does it have to be the Victoria?
妳干嘛非得在维多利亚挣钱啊？

645
00:49:07,800 --> 00:49:09,440
Isn't there any other way to earn?
没有别的办法了吗？

646
00:49:23,600 --> 00:49:24,680
Earn how?
怎么挣啊？

647
00:49:25,440 --> 00:49:26,640
Playing the piano?
弹钢琴啊？

648
00:49:29,360 --> 00:49:31,280
That's not what I meant.
我不是这个意思

649
00:49:31,360 --> 00:49:32,720
Don't take it the wrong way.
妳别误会啊

650
00:49:34,200 --> 00:49:35,560
Look at you.
看妳

651
00:49:35,640 --> 00:49:37,440
What are you so nervous about?
瞎紧张什么呀？

652
00:49:37,520 --> 00:49:38,400
It's fine.
没事

653
00:49:38,480 --> 00:49:39,920
How I got to be what I am —
我自己什么变的

654
00:49:40,000 --> 00:49:41,120
nobody knows better than me.
我自己最清楚

655
00:49:42,760 --> 00:49:44,120
I've done odd jobs before.
我之前打过零工

656
00:49:44,200 --> 00:49:46,320
I washed people's feet in a massage parlor.
在按摩店给人洗过脚

657
00:49:46,400 --> 00:49:49,400
The Victoria is the easiest work I've ever had.
维多利亚干的活是最轻松的活

658
00:49:51,600 --> 00:49:52,560
Fried starch jelly.
煎粉

659
00:49:56,080 --> 00:49:57,600
I used to sell it, you know.
我还卖过煎粉呢

660
00:49:58,360 --> 00:49:59,560
You sold fried starch jelly?
妳卖煎粉？

661
00:50:00,440 --> 00:50:01,520
You don't believe me?
妳不信啊？

662
00:50:02,080 --> 00:50:03,840
It's how my mom made her living.
我妈之前就是卖煎粉的

663
00:50:03,920 --> 00:50:05,480
A two-square-meter cart,
一个两平方公尺的车

664
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:06,920
one pan,
一口锅

665
00:50:07,000 --> 00:50:08,320
one gas cylinder,
一个煤气罐

666
00:50:08,400 --> 00:50:10,280
and my mom standing inside, frying.
我妈就站在里面炒

667
00:50:10,760 --> 00:50:13,200
Every day after school, I'd help her fry too.
我每天放学之后，我也帮我妈炒

668
00:50:13,800 --> 00:50:17,480
She scrimped on everything to keep me in school.
她省吃俭用就是为了供我念书

669
00:50:18,800 --> 00:50:20,760
Even the gas she bought was the cheapest kind —
连煤气罐都买最便宜的

670
00:50:20,840 --> 00:50:21,920
refilled on the sly.
私人灌的

671
00:50:23,640 --> 00:50:24,920
Then one day after school,
有一天放学

672
00:50:26,280 --> 00:50:27,400
she wasn't there.
我没看见她

673
00:50:28,920 --> 00:50:30,760
By the time I made it to the hospital,
我后来跑到医院的时候

674
00:50:32,960 --> 00:50:35,520
there wasn't an inch of skin on her that wasn't burned.
她浑身上下没有一块皮是好的

675
00:50:37,920 --> 00:50:40,120
The fucking gas cylinder had exploded.
他妈的，煤气罐子爆炸了

676
00:50:49,000 --> 00:50:51,880
How is your mom now?
那妳妈现在怎么样了？

677
00:50:56,400 --> 00:50:57,720
She drank pesticide and died.
喝农药死了

678
00:50:58,720 --> 00:51:00,360
The hospital fees were too high. There was no money for treatment.
住院费太高了，没钱治

679
00:51:09,720 --> 00:51:10,720
I'm sorry.
对不起啊

680
00:51:10,800 --> 00:51:11,760
Look at you.
看妳

681
00:51:11,840 --> 00:51:14,520
It's got nothing to do with you. What's there to be sorry for?
跟妳又没关系 有什么可对不起的呀？

682
00:51:18,800 --> 00:51:19,920
Not as good as my mom's.
没我妈做得好吃

683
00:51:24,040 --> 00:51:25,280
Ever since then,
从那以后

684
00:51:25,920 --> 00:51:27,720
I've kept reminding myself:
我就一直提醒我自己

685
00:51:29,800 --> 00:51:31,200
don't end up like my mom,
不能像我妈那样

686
00:51:34,200 --> 00:51:35,680
hounded to death for want of money.
被没钱逼死

687
00:51:45,840 --> 00:51:47,360
Why am I even telling you all this?
我跟妳說这些干嘛？

688
00:51:48,080 --> 00:51:49,120
Drink.
喝

689
00:52:02,520 --> 00:52:04,720
You know what I felt, the first time I saw you?
妳知道我第一次見妳什么感觉吗？

690
00:52:07,640 --> 00:52:08,840
What?
什么感觉？

691
00:52:10,800 --> 00:52:12,320
I remember thinking:
我当时就在想

692
00:52:14,600 --> 00:52:17,760
sooner or later, I'm going to become you.
早晚有一天我都要变成妳

693
00:52:19,480 --> 00:52:20,960
Pretty clothes to wear,
有好看的衣服穿

694
00:52:22,080 --> 00:52:23,520
and someone who loves me.
还有人喜欢

695
00:52:31,080 --> 00:52:33,560
Once you actually become me, you won't think that anymore.
等妳真的变成我就不这么想了

696
00:52:42,040 --> 00:52:44,320
You can still tell your story to people.
妳的故事还能跟别人说

697
00:52:48,200 --> 00:52:49,320
I can't.
我不行

698
00:53:00,640 --> 00:53:01,640
Shen Mo.
沈墨

699
00:53:02,640 --> 00:53:04,200
Do we count as friends?
咱俩算是朋友吗？

700
00:53:05,920 --> 00:53:07,120
Of course we do.
当然算

701
00:53:09,800 --> 00:53:11,880
Then whenever you feel like telling it,
那等妳之后什么时候想说了

702
00:53:12,760 --> 00:53:13,920
tell me.
就跟我说

703
00:53:20,360 --> 00:53:21,360
Okay.
好

704
00:53:28,360 --> 00:53:29,560
I'll go with you.
我陪妳去

705
00:53:40,800 --> 00:53:47,000
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

706
00:53:47,080 --> 00:53:52,840
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

707
00:53:52,920 --> 00:53:59,120
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

708
00:54:57,240 --> 00:54:59,560
It's late. I need to get back to the dorm.
太晚了，我要回宿舍了

709
00:55:00,600 --> 00:55:02,000
Finish this glass first.
喝完这杯吧

710
00:55:02,080 --> 00:55:03,680
I'll walk you back.
我陪妳走回去

711
00:55:08,000 --> 00:55:08,920
To friends.
为了朋友

712
00:55:14,400 --> 00:55:15,600
To friends.
为了朋友

